    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d622-a9">

                <pb facs="0737" n="651" xml:id="pg651"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 9.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stubbs to Mr.
                            Clayton.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Coatzacoalcos</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have telegraphed Federal Judge Juchitan for information. Meloy dead.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. R. Stubbs</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Consular Agent.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
